This is one of the most effective ways to make a grid responsive and prevent overflow.

```css
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
}
```

- `auto-fit` tells the grid to fit as many items as possible.
- `minmax(200px, 1fr)` ensures each item is at least 200px wide (adjust as needed) and scales to fill the container.

